                  "name": "What types of experiences does Sekar Bali Activity offer?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "We offer three intimate, village-led experiences in the historic Pejeng district (near Ubud, Bali): a scenic Village & Terrace Cycling Tour, an authentic Luwak Coffee Plantation Experience (Umah Kuno), and a hands-on Traditional Balinese Dinner Cooking Class."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Where do the tours take place, and is pickup included?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "All our experiences take place in the peaceful village of Pejeng, away from the typical tourist crowds. We offer convenient pickup services in the Ubud area so you can relax and enjoy the day."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Are your tours suitable for large groups?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "We deliberately keep our groups comfortably small. This ensures a safe, unhurried pace, allowing for more personal conversations with our local hosts and a deeper connection to the Balinese culture around you."
                  }
                },
