                    "text": "Our authentic experiences start at a highly accessible price point to support the local village economy: Cycling Tour & Cooking Class are IDR 400,000 per adult (IDR 350,000 per child), and the Luwak Coffee Experience is IDR 400,000 per person (requires a minimum booking of 3 people)."
